{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-my-1st-years-table-top-houses-2605-0156","content_id":"6dee644b-4c9d-457d-ba1b-6fe22da5aac7","description":"Product Recall for My 1st Years Table Top Houses presenting a high risk of injuries and choking.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cc929cee-770d-4da4-8b72-2c1fef4d38c1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-06-02T12:41:15+01:00","id":"cc929cee-770d-4da4-8b72-2c1fef4d38c1","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-06-02T12:41:15+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a1ec15b65bc5f798327f658/2605-0156_-product-recall-my-first-years-table-top-houses.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: My 1st Years Table Top Houses</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a risk of injuries and choking because small, sharp parts can easily detach.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by My 1st Years.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Dolls Building/Settings</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>My 1st Years</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Pastel coloured themed wooden houses.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cc929cee-770d-4da4-8b72-2c1fef4d38c1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a1ec15b65bc5f798327f658/2605-0156_-product-recall-my-first-years-table-top-houses.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"product-identifiers\">Product Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product ID</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Batch</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Small Doll’s House (FSC)</td>\n      <td>50112730</td>\n      <td>06/24</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>NHM Table Top Museum (FSC)</td>\n      <td>50113198</td>\n      <td>04/25</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tabletop Zoo (FSC)</td>\n      <td>50113402</td>\n      <td>11/24</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Just Bee Kids Doll’s House (FSC)</td>\n      <td>50112736</td>\n      <td>06/24</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of injuries because the front roof, screws and hinges can detach during play. The detached screws have sharp points and may cause injuries. The screws are also small parts, and therefore pose a choking hazard to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled by My 1st Years.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using this product immediately and keep it out of reach of young children. To register for a refund, please follow the instructions provided at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.my1styears.com/product-recalls-safety-notices\">https://www.my1styears.com/product-recalls-safety-notices</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0156</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-02T11:42:11Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"product-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Product Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-06-02","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-02T12:42:11+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-my-1st-years-table-top-houses-2605-0156","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-my-1st-years-table-top-houses-2605-0156","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-my-1st-years-table-top-houses-2605-0156","content_id":"6dee644b-4c9d-457d-ba1b-6fe22da5aac7","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-02T11:42:11Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: My 1st Years Table Top Houses (2605-0156)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-my-1st-years-table-top-houses-2605-0156","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filtera